                                "sense_id": "5417a768-f9b2-3720-b1df-b42239300e17",
                                "text": "Girls broadly fared worse than boys, and there is “ongoing and extreme distress” among teens who identify as lesbian, gay, bisexual or questioning (LGBQ+)."
